								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/opus.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Warpig<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=402"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:murgen21@yahoo.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1160.msg11476#msg11476"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1160.msg11476#msg11476">Re: Parents.. a little help plz..</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #16 on:</b> September 29, 2004, 03:23:42 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							ewwww.... bad visual... one more reason I should never, ever, ever have kids!&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/devil1.gif" alt="Devil" border="0" /><br /><br />Dwalion, attacking someone&#039;s parenting skills certainly wasn&#039;t called for here.&nbsp; I&#039;d imagine that this kind of shit (pun intended&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/cool.gif" alt="Cool" border="0" />) can happen surprisingly fast.&nbsp; Some kids are just weird like that. Freud called it the anal fixation stage.&nbsp; Of course Freud was full of shit, but what the hell.&nbsp; <br /><br />Save the rants for when your group&#039;s only healer keeps going on extended afks to take care of the baby, especially when it&#039;s a time limited adventure or something.&nbsp; Log the fuck off EQ!&nbsp; Don&#039;t join my group!&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/banghead2.gif" alt="banghead2" border="0" /><br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
