								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/lampgod.jpg" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Swim in the calm tonight, this art does drown...<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=839"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1160.msg11482#msg11482"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1160.msg11482#msg11482">Re: Parents.. a little help plz..</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #21 on:</b> September 29, 2004, 08:38:04 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							have a safe trip back to bellevue Dwal.. this picture was takin at 830 in the morning.&nbsp; Anna&#039;s normal wake up time is around 9 ish.. *im a stay at home father* i was doin the dishes when a strange odor started coming into the kitchen.. run to anna&#039;s room and voila.. poopy on the walls. ive watched through the crack of the door and watched anna take her diaper off not 30 seconds after ive changed her.. kid is just too smart.. <br /><br />So thank you dr spock for your lecture on my lack of parental skills.. but until you are me.. or live with me you don&#039;t know a fucking thing about me or how I good/bad a parent i am.. share some stories of the stuff your kids have done.. i&#039;d love to pick them apart and tell you how much of a dumbshit / bad parent you are.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
