	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg11502"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=402" title="View the profile of Callon">Callon</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Drolvarg Guardian<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 320<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/opus.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Warpig<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=402"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:murgen21@yahoo.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1160.msg11502#msg11502"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1160.msg11502#msg11502">Re: Parents.. a little help plz..</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #26 on:</b> September 30, 2004, 01:49:47 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">but maybe I&#039;ll just adopt a 21 year old with their own apartment and a six figure income...</div><br />hmm... I&#039;m still in my 20s but I&#039;ll take one too... if she&#039;s cute.   <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/cool.gif" alt="Cool" border="0" />  <br /><br />As for this thread, what actually boggles me, Incy, is that you&#039;d ask on an EQ board what to do about a baby who has fun flinging feces (alliteration!&nbsp; woot!).&nbsp; It just seems.... odd.&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg11504"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=345" title="View the profile of Dwalion SoulVoid">Dwalion SoulVoid</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Splitpaw Gnoll<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 62<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								Gnomercy~!!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=345"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1160.msg11504#msg11504"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1160.msg11504#msg11504">Re: Parents.. a little help plz..</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #27 on:</b> September 30, 2004, 02:29:41 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I am having trouble putting my thoughts into words, the post earlier was quite rash and very judgemental.&nbsp; I do mean it and it strikes a great pain in my heart to even THINK for a moment there is a chance at abuse.<br /><br />I do want to apologize, this was to be only directed at the author of the post, not to anyone else, however, you guys too have had similiar situations occur, which I can understand the proximity of my repsonse affecting you all.<br /><br />I am sorry if my post does not apply to you and I am sorry for the insinuation.<br /><br />If you have doubts about anything, please confer with your clergymen, doctor, or counselor.<br /><br />If my apology is in vain, God help you.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Dwalion SoulVoid &lt;Arirang&gt;<br />70 Necromancer <br /><br />You will more than likely post something stupid and I will respond with something witty.&nbsp; I will more than likely post something stupid and you will respond with something witty.
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg11506"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=745" title="View the profile of Needaa">Needaa</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Female.gif" alt="Female" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 32<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								
								
								<a href="http://edit.yahoo.com/config/send_webmesg?.target=miladymouse"><img src="http://opi.yahoo.com/online?u=miladymouse&amp;m=g&amp;t=0" alt="miladymouse" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="aim:goim?screenname=miladymouse&amp;message=Hi.+Are+you+there?"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/aim.gif" alt="miladymouse" border="0" /></a><br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=745"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1160.msg11506#msg11506"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1160.msg11506#msg11506">Re: Parents.. a little help plz..</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #28 on:</b> September 30, 2004, 04:03:09 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							You know Dwalion, you&#039;re a real idiot!  Incy&#039;s situation is one that HAS happened to all of us one time or another and obviously, you&#039;re the one with real issues--not him.  As I stated before, I am the mother of four children, what I did not tell you is that I&#039;m also a foster mother for the past 10 years.  And considering its mandatory to go for specialized childcare trainings once a month, I seriously doubt you even come close to the knowledge I have.  <br /><br />I admire people like Incy because they ask questions and don&#039;t pretend to know all the answers to parenting.  Believe you me, I don&#039;t have all the answers either, but I can tell you that what happened to him happens to a lot of us and perhaps one day will even happen to you, if by chance any fool would ever have another child with you.  What scares me the most about peeps like you is that I&#039;ve encountered your kind when their children are given to me for foster care placement.  <br /><br />As for seeking help from clergy, I would strongly suggest that you do so, for you need to show compassion, caring and understanding; and I would also recommend that you attend a few parenting classes! 
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Needaa Spiritfyter<br />Guild Leader, Dark Empire
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg11507"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=15" title="View the profile of Killy">Killy</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Goddess of Whips and Rezzes<br />
								Moderator<br />
								Drolvarg Guardian<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/starmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/starmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/starmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/starmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/starmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Female.gif" alt="Female" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 448<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://home.comcast.net/~nlfalkowski/ss/clericanim02.gif" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								
								<a href="http://members.msn.com/KillyCirce" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/msntalk.gif" alt="KillyCirce" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://edit.yahoo.com/config/send_webmesg?.target=Lepredes"><img src="http://opi.yahoo.com/online?u=Lepredes&amp;m=g&amp;t=0" alt="Lepredes" border="0" /></a>
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=15"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.echoesineternity.org/" title="EIE" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1160.msg11507#msg11507"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1160.msg11507#msg11507">Re: Parents.. a little help plz..</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #29 on:</b> September 30, 2004, 04:08:58 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I know dwalion in RL and ingame.&nbsp; He has apologized.&nbsp; I do believe he was wrong in what he said but he also apologized too.&nbsp; He does have 2 beautiful girls and does a wonderful job at fathering them.&nbsp; Some things happen to people in their life that makes them angry that makes them post w/o thinking.&nbsp; He thought about it and retracted his words.&nbsp; <br /><br />Now back to Incy&#039;s problem.&nbsp; Honey that picture you took, please keep it safe and show it to her first boyfriend.&nbsp; I assure you she will be embarrassed lol.&nbsp; Is the same thing I am doing with my kids.&nbsp; And please please come join some of us at home parents for a morning grind sometime.&nbsp; We drink coffee and grind <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" /> /hugs Good luck to you !!
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><div align="center"><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=1100304" target="_blank"><img src="http://kilaer.tripod.com/sitebuildercontent/sitebuilderpictures/kilaer-1.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a><br /><span style="color: Teal;">What we do in life, &quot;Echoes in Eternity&quot;</span></div>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
